{"seq":2,"slug":"transforming-ci-poetry","title":"Transforming Ci Poetry","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/transforming-ci-poetry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-haofang-style","title":"豪放词的开创","url":"/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/transforming-ci-poetry/the-haofang-style","wordCount":1523,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"expanding-ci","title":"词境的拓展","url":"/c/people/su-shi/core-contributions/transforming-ci-poetry/expanding-ci","wordCount":1712,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现苏轼对宋词的划时代贡献——开创\"豪放\"词派。在苏轼之前，词主要是抒写柔情的\"婉约\"之作、被视为\"艳科\"；而苏轼以\"以诗为词\"的革新，开创了雄健、豪迈、开阔的豪放词风（如《念奴娇·赤壁怀古》），从根本上拓展了词的题材、境界与精神，解放了词体，将词提升为与诗并驾齐驱的文学形式。本章揭示苏轼对词史的划时代贡献。\n"}